A||XN||37||grinthock||Stupid Cops||||8||
Z||000000||grinthock||10-20-2001||09:55 PM||||I am SO PISSED!<P>This drives me nuts... I went for a cruise, having a great time, stopped at the mall parking lot to look at something on the car for a sec (good lighting at night) got back in, forgot to turn my lights on.<P>NOT 2 seconds outside of the parking lot I get pulled over!!!  Ok I understand no lights.<P>So Instead of telling me "Hey did you realize your lights wern't on?"    (My parking lights WERE so my dash was lit) I said "Geez no I didn't, sorry I just left the really well lit parking lot there and didn't even realize"<P>he says "Gimmie a sec I will get your citation"<P>A CITATION!?  WTF!! I never get off, everyone I know get's off 100 over speeding tickets!<P>So I walk over to the cop, and no bull ****  I said "Listen, I just lost my job a week ago, I can't even pay next months rent let alone this ticket, can you cut me some slack?"  <P>I even showed him my final paystub which was in the car to prove it<P>he says "If you goto court you can ask to have it reduced they probably will"<P>So he writes the ticket them comes and gives it to me, after I HAD IT in my hand I said to him "This is stupid, so you tell me if I goto court they will probably reduce it right?"<P>he says<P>"YEah probably reduce it to $10 or even nothing"<P>I told him<P>"So why not just ask me to turn on my lights and let me go instead of us sitting here for 20 minutes?  This is Stupid"<P>He gives me some story about how the biggest threat in burlington is traffic and that they are focusing on that.  <P>I dunno, SO stupid.<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroworld.com</A>  The place to go for Fiero INFO! <BR>Home of my 87 GT and 85 GT<BR>Justin C.<BR>Engineer, Designer and<BR>Technical Trainer for Nortel Networks Business Products.<BR><B>This Sig Has been Castrated by Cliff Pennock</B> ;)||||reg||8
Z||000001||Gary W||10-20-2001||10:02 PM||||Should have told him you were in the mall lot trying to get your f&*(%# headlights to pop up!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif">||||reg||12
Z||000002||WhiteFieroBlur||10-20-2001||11:15 PM||||Man I can't beleive that I would be so pissed too. I always leave my lights off. I love only having my parking lights on when I cruiz. I think my car looks so much better. When I drive on the cruiz that we have here I mostly always keep my lights off and maybe pop em up if I see a cop who might say something, but mostly everyone notices my lights are not on and I never got a ticket. I think I had a cop who was parked in the dark flash his warning yellow lights at me for that but other than that, never been pulled over. I only do it when I drive in well lit roads with alot of street lights, other than that I have to keep em on so I don't crash into something  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.||||reg||1
