Z||000021||Mach10||10-21-2001||08:33 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BlackStang95:<BR><B>Cops in general really do suck.  Yes those in NYC have worked hard lately, and im sure there are plenty out there, but in all my experiences they are total assholes.  I'll tell you several stories why I feel this way. <P>1. My first encounter ever with a cop.  Me and my friend are parked outside AutoZone (in a legal spot), putting my K+N filter in, and this pig comes up, asks us what we are doing (lol) and then says the alarm at this dinky bait store went off and accuessed us of trying to break in (to steal worms??).  After running my license through he tells us to leave and we do. <P>2.  Three times I was pulled over and told to remove these cool flashing red lights (knight rider style) that I put under the front license plate...this looked really cool so I never wanted to do it but I finally did. <P>3.  Ok, this one was prolly my fualt but ill tell it anyway, this stupid kid walks slowly in front of me as im leaving school, so once he finally moves I light up the back tires a bit.  The cop there freaks out like I just shot someone.  He didn't write a ticket but I got suspended.<P>4.  Three times I have been pulled over and harassed for absolutely nothing.  I mean seriously nothing.  One officer claimed he thought I was vandalizing a school cuz i turned around in its parking lot.  Totally ridiculous, cops are evil people and many of them deserve to be shot.  <P>Flame me if you want, but thats the way it is.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You really ARE right out of preschool, aren't you? You stupid punk kid. There isn't a SINGLE example that you've posted that doesn't make you look like a one-eyed trouser weasel. Go stand in the corner.<P>Cliff, can we ban this little nut-stain? He's even getting on MY nerves &gt;:\<P>||||reg||13
